  - "Dio vida a David Myers en \xABThe Man Who Sued God\xBB."
  - "Dio vida a Morgan Leafy, 1st Secretary of the High Commissioner en \xABA Good
    Man in Africa\xBB."
  - "Sus papeles incluyen a Morgan Leafy, 1st Secretary of the High Commissioner
    en \xABA Good Man in Africa\xBB y a Errol en \xABCosi\xBB."
